{"lyrics":"[00:02.16] Um, life's—\n[00:05.72] Oh\n[00:06.80] Mhm\n[00:11.30] Life’s a dungeon, chase the dragon\n[00:14.00] Slaying everything in my path (Ayy)\n[00:16.94] Walk through, blood, sweat, tears in my Rafs (Ayy)\n[00:19.60] Enjoy your time, you can't get it back (Ayy)\n[00:22.84] Life's a dungeon, chase the dragon\n[00:25.30] Slaying everything in my path (Ayy)\n[00:28.22] Walk through, blood, sweat, tears in my Rafs (Ayy)\n[00:30.90] Enjoy your time, you can’t get it back (Ayy)\n[00:34.14] I'm in the lost-and-found\n[00:35.72] All I see is black fire when I walk around\n[00:38.44] So I try to get higher just to calm me down\n[00:41.22] 'Til I end up too high and make me crack a frown\n[00:44.32] R.I.P. to my dad, I hope I see you in Heaven\n[00:47.20] I hate you for dying before I could fix this\n[00:49.94] But I love you for making me, you made a legend\n[00:52.92] Your son is a king, knew I wasn't gon' be a peasant\n[00:55.70] But I'ma do my thing, I'ma do my thing\n[00:58.24] While you look down on me, I'ma get the green\n[01:01.06] Make it rain, word to Rihanna, they gonna need a umbrella-ella-ella, ayy\n[01:05.40] Demons, I’ve been beating, I’ve been fighting hella, hella, ayy\n[01:07.78] Life's a dungeon, chase the dragon\n[01:10.48] Slaying everything in my path (Ayy)\n[01:13.42] Walk through, blood, sweat, tears in my Rafs (Ayy)\n[01:16.12] Enjoy your time, you can’t get it back (Ayy)\n[01:19.10] Life's a dungeon, chase the dragon\n[01:21.78] Slaying everything in my path (Ayy)\n[01:24.72] Walk through, blood, sweat, tears in my Rafs (Ayy)\n[01:27.42] Enjoy your time, you can't get it back (Ayy)\n[01:30.36] Life's a luncheon with no food\n[01:32.62] Been staying to myself, I ain’t tryna come off rude\n[01:35.44] And praying to myself for my health and my boo\n[01:38.26] Got three words for her, ayy, baby, \"I love you\"\n[01:41.40] Losing my head, feel like I'm walking to my doom\n[01:44.10] Touching my dreads, nervous when I walk in the room\n[01:46.80] You happy talking to me, not happy talking to you\n[01:49.58] Hate interactions, conversatin' probably nothin' to you\n[01:52.48] I put them sunglasses on and put them pills in my stomach\n[01:55.22] Then blow that kush, my cologne, crack a seal, yeah, I'm on it\n[01:58.24] Now, I'm ready for the public\n[02:00.06] I can't feel nothin'\n[02:01.42] In my mind, stuck in\n[02:02.78] That's that place, sunken, ooh\n[02:04.88] Sunken, in a pit, sunken\n[02:07.02] My abyss, sunken\n[02:08.44] What'd I learn from it?\n[02:09.60] I don't know, but my diamonds still frozen\n[02:12.76] I'm still chosen, just gotta stay focused\n[02:15.66] Life's a dungeon, chase the dragon\n[02:18.26] Slaying everything in my path (Ayy)\n[02:21.18] Walk through, blood, sweat, tears in my Rafs (Ayy)\n[02:23.84] Enjoy your time, you can't get it back (Ayy)\n[02:26.90] Life's a dungeon, chase the dragon\n[02:29.54] Slaying everything in my path (Ayy)\n[02:32.46] Walk through, blood, sweat, tears in my Rafs (Ayy)\n[02:35.22] Enjoy your time, you can't get it back (Ayy)","words":[[2.16,2.36,"Um,"],[2.8,3.34,"life's—"],[5.72,6.76,"Oh"],[6.8,6.84,"Mhm"],[11.3,11.76,"Life’s"],[11.84,11.84,"a"],[12.0,12.54,"dungeon,"],[12.66,13.16,"chase"],[13.2,13.26,"the"],[13.38,13.9,"dragon"],[14.0,14.66,"Slaying"],[14.8,15.66,"everything"],[15.82,15.94,"in"],[15.98,16.02,"my"],[16.06,16.3,"path"],[16.36,16.5,"(Ayy)"],[16.94,17.08,"Walk"],[17.14,17.38,"through,"],[17.42,17.7,"blood,"],[17.74,18.08,"sweat,"],[18.14,18.52,"tears"],[18.64,18.66,"in"],[18.78,18.8,"my"],[19.1,19.46,"Rafs"],[19.5,19.56,"(Ayy)"],[19.6,19.94,"Enjoy"],[20.0,20.18,"your"],[20.26,20.62,"time,"],[20.7,20.8,"you"],[20.94,21.24,"can't"],[21.34,21.68,"get"],[21.76,21.82,"it"],[21.9,22.22,"back"],[22.72,22.8,"(Ayy)"],[22.84,23.06,"Life's"],[23.14,23.14,"a"],[23.3,23.84,"dungeon,"],[23.94,24.44,"chase"],[24.48,24.56,"the"],[24.66,25.18,"dragon"],[25.3,25.96,"Slaying"],[26.1,26.96,"everything"],[27.12,27.24,"in"],[27.28,27.4,"my"],[27.48,2